Third-party software in this repository keeps its own licence:

- vendor/my-office/ is my-office (https://github.com/khanh020905/my-office),
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 khanh020905. Its licence is vendor/my-office/LICENSE.
  The files under shared/upstream/ are taken from it too.
- vendor/my-office/three/ is three.js, MIT, Copyright © 2010-2023 three.js
  authors. Its licence is vendor/my-office/three/LICENSE.
- server/world.generated.ts is built from both and carries both notices.
- vendor/genui/ is the renderer of the Generative UI plugin
  (https://github.com/anh-chu/paseo-plugin-genui, ported from
  https://github.com/ComicBit/bb-plugin-genui), Apache License 2.0. Its licence is
  vendor/genui/LICENSE, which is the licence text; the upstream repository has no NOTICE file.
  Upstream's files are copied unchanged; the changes made to them are stated in
  vendor/SOURCES.md and in the banner of client/genui-kit.generated.ts, which is built from
  vendor/genui/ and carries that notice.
